---
/**
 * Sets the theme on <html> before the first paint: synchronous, in <head>, and
 * embedded whole because nothing bundled would run in time. Adapted from
 * karhdo.dev's `ThemeScript.astro` (MIT, see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
 *
 * `localStorage.theme` holds the choice: `light` or `dark`, and no key means
 * "system". <html> carries `data-theme` (the colours) and `data-theme-pref`
 * (the choice, for the toggle's icon). The script ships in every page, so its
 * notes live here.
 */
import themeInline from "@/scripts/themeInline.js?raw";
---

<script is:inline set:html={themeInline} />
